      "notes": {
        "public": "",
        "value": "<h2>Printed Statblock</h2><p><strong>Hit Dice:</strong> 3d8+9 (22 hp)</p><p><strong>Initiative:</strong> +1</p><p><strong>Speed:</strong> 20 ft. in masterwork scale mail (4 squares); base 30 ft.</p><p><strong>Armor Class:</strong> 18 (-1 size, +1 Agy, +2 natural, +4 masterwork scale mail, +2 heavy shield), touch 10, flat-footed 17</p><p><strong>Base Attack/Grapple:</strong> +3/+11</p><p><strong>Attack:</strong> +1 longsword +7 melee (2d6+5/19-20)</p><p><strong>Full Attack:</strong> +1 longsword +7 melee (2d6+5/19-20) or +1 spear +7 melee (2d6+5/x3), or +1 spear +4 ranged (2d6+5/x3)</p><p><strong>Space/Reach:</strong> 10 ft./10 ft.</p><p><strong>Special Attacks:</strong> -</p><p><strong>Special Qualities:</strong> Darkvision 60 ft., heritage qualities</p><p><strong>Saves:</strong> Fort +6, Ref +2, Will +3</p><p><strong>Abilities:</strong> Str 19, Agy 12, Sta 16, Int 13, Spt 10, Cha 6</p><p><strong>Skills:</strong> Knowledge (arcana) +5, Knowledge (military tactics) +5, Spellcraft +8, Spot +6</p><p><strong>Feats:</strong> Cleave, Power Attack</p><p><strong>Area:</strong> Any</p><p><strong>Organization:</strong> Unit (10-100), squadron (40-400), or army (100-1000)</p><p><strong>Treasure:</strong> Standard (weapons and armor)</p><p><strong>Advancement:</strong> By racial levels or character class</p><p><strong>Level Adjustment:</strong> Use racial levels</p><p><strong>Manual boundary:</strong> situational targeting, tactical decisions, and exceptional special abilities remain GM-adjudicated unless an embedded item provides a roll or effect.</p>"
